    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/6c0403bd9b8ec7170ff6b86b5aaaac5c.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>The world of Emptiness comes to life with vibrant colors, symbolizing the player's emotions and experiences. Colors change the physical properties of objects, unlocking new paths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/4c52f2c4685794c50d10f07ebc264a26.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/4c52f2c4685794c50d10f07ebc264a26.webm?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/4c52f2c4685794c50d10f07ebc264a26.mp4?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/f4b0eb863301fdeb7932492902cb861b.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>The main character is &quot;unborn,&quot; dark, alive but lifeless, without distinct features or distortions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/69418673a8915dca252aa2418ab71181.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/69418673a8915dca252aa2418ab71181.webm?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/69418673a8915dca252aa2418ab71181.mp4?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/956435937c82f91d7e409c186d2b5583.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>The main character encounters souls that have rejected self-discovery and become sources of darkness, feeding on other souls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/bd77970c683acaa806dd3ed9f04c3933.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/bd77970c683acaa806dd3ed9f04c3933.webm?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/bd77970c683acaa806dd3ed9f04c3933.mp4?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/835663e1e1f18d370ccb61e0b391e538.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>The game includes elements from HOOK by Maciej Targoni, seamlessly integrated into Emptiness, enhancing puzzles for a unique experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/6140539ec7dd770264e17f2d3c046f47.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/6140539ec7dd770264e17f2d3c046f47.webm?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/6140539ec7dd770264e17f2d3c046f47.mp4?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/fd2527b46a73345ac6173f5fd9b0c518.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>Immerse yourself in Emptiness: puzzles, platforming, and dark souls searching for their path in the spirit world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/c931a5c98da1b8a260a94fa7831c2364.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/c931a5c98da1b8a260a94fa7831c2364.webm?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/c931a5c98da1b8a260a94fa7831c2364.mp4?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/1e8439036243bef8a238a7800afc2aee.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>Emptiness uses minimalist pixel art, conveying information through symbols and gestures, making the game accessible to all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/cfe40aca47aec8c01a109cd9bb381d9d.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/cfe40aca47aec8c01a109cd9bb381d9d.mp4?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/692a757d064aedabb81b03a7f8eaba78.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>Emptiness is a journey into the fourth dimension, where souls take on forms reflecting their past lives.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/0e841a3fb68a82565331e5e0cfc5f556.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/0e841a3fb68a82565331e5e0cfc5f556.webm?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/caabb111b4cd8dcc31b20b883d425d24.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>The game's complexity grows, offering new puzzles and revealing the mysteries of the void.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/56676f2710b785d9752c17c0a60e4efd.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" width=744 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/56676f2710b785d9752c17c0a60e4efd.webm?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/56676f2710b785d9752c17c0a60e4efd.mp4?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/8bf85c63a95ff57affec7aacef75b5cd.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>The character knows nothing of the world; platforms vanish, but color improves their perception and memory.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/78ec13c86bd6178c98c30d60ef42c69a.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/78ec13c86bd6178c98c30d60ef42c69a.webm?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/c8eff0c13767c41ec2d48b297b42fb71.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>Our games form a single world with three connected stories. Emptiness is a key part, completing the overall picture.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/f6e88382fa9d693cc72befc31faa0fb2.avif?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br><i>The journey from emptiness to nowhere is a unique experience that immerses you in a world and introduces you to its inhabitants.</i>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/6c0403bd9b8ec7170ff6b86b5aaaac5c.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>The world of Emptiness comes to life with vibrant colors, symbolizing the player's emotions and experiences. Colors change the physical properties of objects, unlocking new paths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/4c52f2c4685794c50d10f07ebc264a26.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/4c52f2c4685794c50d10f07ebc264a26.webm?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/4c52f2c4685794c50d10f07ebc264a26.mp4?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/f4b0eb863301fdeb7932492902cb861b.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>The main character is &quot;unborn,&quot; dark, alive but lifeless, without distinct features or distortions.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/69418673a8915dca252aa2418ab71181.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/69418673a8915dca252aa2418ab71181.webm?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/69418673a8915dca252aa2418ab71181.mp4?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/956435937c82f91d7e409c186d2b5583.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>The main character encounters souls that have rejected self-discovery and become sources of darkness, feeding on other souls.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/bd77970c683acaa806dd3ed9f04c3933.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/bd77970c683acaa806dd3ed9f04c3933.webm?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/bd77970c683acaa806dd3ed9f04c3933.mp4?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/835663e1e1f18d370ccb61e0b391e538.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>The game includes elements from HOOK by Maciej Targoni, seamlessly integrated into Emptiness, enhancing puzzles for a unique experience.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/6140539ec7dd770264e17f2d3c046f47.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/6140539ec7dd770264e17f2d3c046f47.webm?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/6140539ec7dd770264e17f2d3c046f47.mp4?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/fd2527b46a73345ac6173f5fd9b0c518.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>Immerse yourself in Emptiness: puzzles, platforming, and dark souls searching for their path in the spirit world.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/c931a5c98da1b8a260a94fa7831c2364.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/c931a5c98da1b8a260a94fa7831c2364.webm?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/c931a5c98da1b8a260a94fa7831c2364.mp4?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/1e8439036243bef8a238a7800afc2aee.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>Emptiness uses minimalist pixel art, conveying information through symbols and gestures, making the game accessible to all.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/cfe40aca47aec8c01a109cd9bb381d9d.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/cfe40aca47aec8c01a109cd9bb381d9d.mp4?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/692a757d064aedabb81b03a7f8eaba78.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><