kamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/78ec13c86bd6178c98c30d60ef42c69a.poster.avif?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/78ec13c86bd6178c98c30d60ef42c69a.webm?t=1736611495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/c8eff0c13767c41ec2d48b297b42fb71.webp?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=50 /></span><br>Our games form a single world with three connected stories. Emptiness is a key part, completing the overall picture.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2761760/extras/f6e88382fa9d693cc72befc31faa0fb2.avif?t=1736611495\" width=616 height=200 /></span><br><br><i>The journey from emptiness to nowhere is a unique experience that immerses you in a world and introduces you to its inhabitants.</i>",
